          <span class="unit">岁</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fld sg">
        <span class="fld-l">初始身份 <span class="fhint">12 预设 + 自定义 · 风味加成</span></span>
        <div class="id-grid" id="idGrid"></div>
        <div class="id-custom" id="idCustom" hidden>
          <p class="idc-hint">✧ <b>自定义身份</b> —— 自由描述你的来路与专长，AI 将据此编织你的过去。</p>
          <input class="inp" id="idCustomName" type="text" maxlength="16" autocomplete="off" placeholder="身份名称，如：漫游剑客 / 落魄贵族 / 战地记者">
          <input class="inp" id="idCustomNote" type="text" maxlength="30" autocomplete="off" placeholder="一句风味说明，如：用过三把剑，丢过两匹马">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fld sg">
        <span class="fld-l">时代背景 <span class="fhint">你从哪个年代被带上方舟</span></span>
        <div class="chipbox" id="eraChips" role="group" aria-label="时代背景选择"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="sec-h sg">性格特质 <span class="en">PERSONALITY</span><span class="cnt" id="trCnt"></span></div>
